          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clap to meet %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tepuk tangan, temui %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "COIN!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KOIN!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cover your face" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutup wajahmu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Credits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kredit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delicious! Let's groom together." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enak! Ayo dandan bareng."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't be fooled by his cute looks! He loves to settle on top of people's heads and slowly drain the sadness from their aura. If your head suddenly feels heavy, he might be the culprit..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jangan tertipu dengan bentuk lucunya! Dia senang menetap di atas kepala manusia dan perlahan-lahan menyedot aura kesedihanmu. Kalau kepalamu tiba-tiba terasa berat, mungkin dia pelakunya..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't move" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jangan bergerak"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selesai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every ghost asks for a secret hand sign: a thumbs up, a wave, a peace sign… Do it in front of the camera to hear the rest of its story." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiap hantu meminta isyarat tangan rahasia: jempol, lambaian, tanda damai… Lakukan di depan kamera untuk mendengar kelanjutan ceritanya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every ghost asks for a secret move: a smile, a wink, a wave… Do it and the ghost hops to your shoulder, your hand, or your face to tell you more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiap hantu meminta gerakan rahasia: senyum, kedipan, lambaian… Lakukan, dan hantu akan melompat ke pundak, tangan, atau wajahmu untuk bercerita lebih banyak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fine, you win. Seen a little witch whose broom can't turn?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oke, kamu menang. Lihat penyihir cilik yang sapunya tak bisa belok?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends share secrets. Let me read your palm…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teman berbagi rahasia. Biar kubaca telapakmu…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teman!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ghost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ghost info" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Info hantu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Good evening. Forgive the intrusion. Shall we greet?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selamat malam. Maaf mengganggu. Boleh kita bersalam?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hehe!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hehe!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hehe… hide and seek! You count first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hehe… petak umpet! Kamu jaga duluan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hello? HELLO? Can anybody see me?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halo? HALO? Ada yang bisa melihatku?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi hi!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai hai!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides around your head, shoulders, and hands" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bersembunyi di sekitar kepala, pundak, dan tanganmu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hmph!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hmph!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hmph… I'm calm now. In the next grave, a ghost needs a hug." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hmph… aku tenang. Di kuburan sebelah, ada hantu yang butuh pelukan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold both hands together in front of the camera until the circle fills up. He might not stay cute..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Satukan kedua tangan di depan kamera sampai lingkarannya penuh. Dia belum tentu tetap imut..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hug!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Peluk!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm clinging to you! Hug me?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aku menempel padamu! Peluk aku?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm your parrot now! Know the pirate signal?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sekarang aku beomu! Tahu kode bajak laut?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "INSERT COIN TO CONTINUE." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MASUKKAN KOIN UNTUK LANJUT."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It worked! The tea is… slightly colder. A polite guest is knocking…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berhasil! Tehnya jadi… sedikit lebih dingin. Ada tamu sopan mengetuk…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "K.O.!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "K.O.!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LET'S GO" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AYO MULAI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liar! Prove you're brave!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bohong! Buktikan kamu berani!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Little Witch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penyihir Cilik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a fist" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kepalkan tangan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meet Mister Q" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kenalan dengan Mister Q"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missed! I'm right here. BOO! Scared?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Luput! Aku di sini. BAA! Kaget?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mister Q (The Cute Ghost)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mister Q (Si Hantu Imut)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mister Q (True Form)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mister Q (Wujud Asli)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mlem!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mlem!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mochi loved napping so much that she kept doing it in the afterlife. Her ears still twitch whenever someone opens a can of tuna." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mochi sangat suka tidur siang sampai-sampai dia terus melakukannya di alam baka. Telinganya masih bergerak setiap kali ada yang membuka kaleng tuna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mochi the Ghost Cat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mochi si Kucing Hantu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mochi's twin sister prefers dark corners. Her glowing eyes look spooky, but she only wants to knock your things off the table." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saudari kembar Mochi ini lebih suka sudut yang gelap. Matanya yang menyala terlihat seram, padahal dia cuma ingin menjatuhkan barang-barangmu dari meja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Music" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Musik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mwah!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Muah!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My apologies. A pirate keeps asking for the nearest bathtub…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mohon maaf. Ada bajak laut yang terus mencari bak mandi…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My first hug ever! My friend Wavy still waves at no one…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pelukan pertamaku! Temanku Wavy masih melambai ke orang yang tak membalas…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NEXT" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LANJUT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No sadness in your future! But someone is FURIOUS I turned nice…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Masa depanmu tidak sedih! Tapi ada yang MARAH aku jadi baik…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nobody ever hugs me back. A kiss from afar?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tak ada yang pernah memelukku. Cium dari jauh?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nod your head" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anggukkan kepala"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nori the Shadow Cat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nori si Kucing Bayangan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not Now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nanti Saja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only ghost-seers know the secret signal…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya yang bisa melihat hantu tahu kode rahasianya…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OOF!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ADUH!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ooh, fancy!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ooh, keren!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OPEN SETTINGS" : {
