          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Luar biasa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Squawk!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kwaak!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "START!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MULAI!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick your tongue out" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Julurkan lidahmu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Story complete!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cerita selesai!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SUMMON THE GHOST" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PANGGIL HANTU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summoning the ghost…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memanggil hantu…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sweet! Will you be my friend?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manis! Mau jadi temanku?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take a photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ambil foto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terima kasih."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app has no accounts, no analytics, no ads, and no tracking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi ini tidak punya akun, analitik, iklan, maupun pelacakan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera is paused." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamera sedang dijeda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera is used only while the ghost is on screen, to show it in augmented reality and to detect your face and hand gestures. All camera images are processed on your device in real time and are never saved or sent anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamera hanya dipakai selama hantu tampil di layar, untuk menampilkannya dalam augmented reality dan mendeteksi wajah serta gestur tanganmu. Semua gambar kamera diproses langsung di perangkatmu dan tidak pernah disimpan atau dikirim ke mana pun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ghost couldn't be summoned." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu gagal dipanggil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ghost needs your camera" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu butuh kameramu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most polite reaper in the underworld. He always tips his hat first, and he only uses his scythe to trim the graveyard grass." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Malaikat maut paling sopan di alam baka. Dia selalu mengangkat topinya lebih dulu, dan sabitnya hanya dipakai untuk memangkas rumput kuburan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The real treasure was the crew. Hey… hear coins clinking?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Harta sejati adalah awak kapal. Eh… dengar bunyi koin?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The treasure map was in your hand all along! Hold tight!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Peta hartanya ada di tanganmu! Genggam erat!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device doesn't support augmented reality." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perangkat ini tidak mendukung augmented reality."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is what Mister Q really looks like when he's angry. Clap again quickly, maybe he'll turn cute again..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beginilah wujud asli Mister Q saat sedang marah. Cepat tepuk tangan lagi, siapa tahu dia kembali imut..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thumbs up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Acungkan jempol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tilt your head" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Miringkan kepala"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch the ghost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sentuh hantunya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Treasure!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Harta karun!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coba Lagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuna!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tuna!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vibration" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Getaran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wave your hand" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lambaikan tangan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wavy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wavy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wavy waves at everyone he floats past. Nobody ever waves back, because nobody can see him... except you. Wave back!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wavy melambai pada semua orang yang dia lewati. Tidak ada yang membalas, karena tidak ada yang bisa melihatnya... kecuali kamu. Balas lambaiannya!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wheee! My broom can't steer! Which way?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wiii! Sapuku tak bisa belok! Ke mana?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WHO MADE MISTER Q SOFT?! Was it YOU?!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SIAPA YANG MEMBUAT MISTER Q LEMBEK?! KAMU?!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoosh!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wusss!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wink one eye" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kedipkan satu mata"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "YOU CAN SEE ME! Quick, a selfie!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KAMU BISA MELIHATKU! Cepat, swafoto!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You found me?! Catch me, quick!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketahuan?! Tangkap aku, cepat!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "YOU WIN! CONTINUE? Mister Q waits at level 1." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KAMU MENANG! LANJUT? Mister Q menunggu di level 1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ghost photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Foto hantumu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your hand went through me… Come closer, I'll whisper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanganmu tembus… Mendekatlah, aku mau berbisik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name is on my list… I must take your measurements." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nama Anda ada di daftar saya… Saya harus mengukur Anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yum!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nyam!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zzz… purrr… (Shh, don't wake her.)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zzz… purrr… (Sst, jangan bangunkan dia.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "…Not bad. Now blow my anger away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…Lumayan. Sekarang tiup amarahku pergi."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
